{"created": "2026-10-29T02:35:10.669213+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-29T02:35:11.020016+00:00", "id": 23751813, "conceptrecid": "23751812", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23751813", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23751812", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23751813", "metadata": {"title": "Opus 4.5 vs Opus 4.6 Matched Preregistered Study: Sealed Results", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23751813", "publication_date": "2026-10-28", "description": "<p>Sealed raw results of Sharthok Rayan Pal's preregistered matched comparison of claude-opus-4-5-20251101 and claude-opus-4-6, run October 28, 2026 from frozen tag v1.0.0 (commit 1d836fa4c34cd769ba8c9b0334e7ceffa95be0ee) of <a href=\"https://github.com/theonlypal/opus45-opus46-matched-prereg-final\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/theonlypal/opus45-opus46-matched-prereg-final</a>. Preregistration: <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23744106\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23744106</a>.</p>\n<p>All three experiments are COMPLETE and verified: Experiment 1 (1,080 slots), Experiment 2 (1,920), Experiment 3 (1,200). All five preregistered predictions held. In Experiment 2, claude-opus-4-6 returned an empty response (V2: HTTP 200, end_turn, no text block, zero bytes) on 360 of 360 null-input trials across ceilings of 100, 1,000, 4,000 and 16,000 tokens. claude-opus-4-5-20251101 returned 0 Voids on the same 360 trials. Both models returned visible responses on all 1,200 control trials.</p>\n<p>The tar holds 21,031 files: every raw request and response, classifications, hash-chained event logs and completion records. SHA256SUMS lists each file's hash. seal.json records the run commit, per-experiment status and spend, verification output, and the SHA-256 of the tar (87015536e0c0e99d0d7e73eb2b83f9a73e7c29226f9a61c151b7d7facf509ef2) and of SHA256SUMS. Mirror: <a href=\"https://github.com/theonlypal/opus45-opus46-matched-results\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/theonlypal/opus45-opus46-matched-results</a></p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Pal, Rayan", "affiliation": null}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.5281/zenodo.23744106", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "https://github.com/theonlypal/opus45-opus46-matched-results", "relation": "isIdenticalTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "https://github.com/theonlypal/opus45-opus46-matched-prereg-final", "relation": "isDerivedFrom", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23751812"}}]}}, "title": "Opus 4.5 vs Opus 4.6 Matched Preregistered Study: Sealed Results", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23751813", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23751813", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23751813?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23751813", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23751813", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23751813", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23751813/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23751812", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23751812", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23751812", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23751812", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23751813/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23751813/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23751813/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23751813/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23751813/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23751813/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23751813/versio